# Schema: the repository-case manifest, cli/tests/harness/case.rs. Textproto,
# but not a Buri file: only repo/ below is a Buri repository.

doc: "an analysis the server keeps is only reused while everything it was worked out from still stands: the file a language's check reads through `needs`, and the check tool itself, each edited and put back, re-analyse the file that imports what the checked input generates"

run {
  args: ["lsp"]
  exit: 0
  stdin: "session.jsonl"
  stream: OUT
  golden: "session.txt"
}
